{"version":1,"content":"<p>本港周五（23日）天晴，早上市區最低氣溫約25°C，新界再低兩三度，日間炎熱及非常乾燥，最高氣溫約32°C。</p><p>吹和緩北至西北風，離岸風勢間中清勁，高地達強風程度。</p><p>展望隨後一兩日天晴及非常乾燥，部分地區酷熱，日夜溫差頗大，下周初部分時間有陽光。</p><p>(天文台)</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T14:02:19.526888+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T13:25:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T06:58:04.722425+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T13:57:43.782920+00:00","content_hash":"8ba53e7ff6d9d4c8edde5a6422ab7347444b7ec2517d0c8ad478589f80f77cf3","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}